msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk
#: index.docbook:348
#, no-c-format
msgid "If the scanned image includes more than you want to appear in the final image, use this tool to crop your image by marking your selection in the larger image display to the right then selecting this tool. The image is cropped according to your selection. You may already be familiar with this function from <application>The GIMP</application> crop tool."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#. +> trunk
